```

Fix: Change to `internal class GenericOperationSource<[DynamicallyAccessedMembers(DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.PublicConstructors | DynamicallyAccessedMemberTypes.NonPublicConstructors)] T> : IOperationSource<T>`

`using System.Diagnostics.CodeAnalysis;` is already present at line 8.

**3. Extensions/ArmClientBuilderExtensions.cs** - IL2026/IL3050: The method `AddArmClient<TBuilder, TConfiguration>` calls `RegisterClientFactory` which has `[RequiresUnreferencedCode]` and `[RequiresDynamicCode]`. Mark the method with both attributes.

